# Response headers for the Cloudflare build's static files (cloudflare/wrangler.jsonc).
# js/cloud.js looks for this Server-Timing mark on the page's own response, so only the Worker build ever calls
# api/hello. The claude.ai artifact and a local copy make no request and log no 404.
/*
  Server-Timing: sd-cloud
# The home-screen manifest (index.html's <head>): its own type, so every browser reads it as one.
/manifest.webmanifest
  Content-Type: application/manifest+json
